Install the PE_halt_restart hook and arm the WDT before the clean shutdown.

The unattended reboot still hangs/panics: reboot_kernel() ->
halt_all_cpus(TRUE) -> PEHaltRestart(kPERestartCPU) waits for the fake
PMU/root-domain shutdown handshake, times out after 30 s and panics
("Halt/Restart Timed Out 010 /PlatformExpert.cpp:884 handshake structure not
initialized").  The platform reset hook `PE_halt_restart` (global function
pointer in iokit/Kernel/IOPlatformExpert.cpp, called by
IOPlatformExpert::haltRestart) is NULL on this port, so neither the normal
path nor the panic path can reset.  The KPSS watchdog bite (0135) is already
hardware-validated.

0137 (bsd/dev/onc_emmc.c only):
  A) `PE_halt_restart` is set to `sweet_pe_halt_restart()` early in
     onc_emmc_init(): it prints "SWEET HALT: type=%u -> WDT reset" and runs
     the existing reset fallback (PSCI attempt -> KPSS WDT bite 0x2000 ~250 ms)
     and never returns.  The WDT page is mapped at hook-install time, so the
     hook also works from panic context.  Assignment banner:
     "SWEET HALT: PE_halt_restart hooked (WDT reset)".
  B) sweetrebootat: after "SWEET REBOOT: firing now" the WDT is armed FIRST
     for a short timeout (boot arg `sweetrebootticks`, default 0x40000 = 8 s
     at 32768 Hz): "SWEET WDT: armed bite in <ticks> ticks (pre-shutdown)";
     then the 45 s failsafe thread starts and reboot_kernel(RB_AUTOBOOT) is
     called.  A hang/30 s panic therefore still ends in a reset <= 8 s.
  C) sweetpscireset and the PSCI->WDT fallback semantics are unchanged; all
     boot args stay default-OFF.

Expected new console lines in a sweetrebootat cycle:
  SWEET HALT: PE_halt_restart hooked (WDT reset)          (boot, once)
  ...
  SWEET REBOOT: firing now
  SWEET WDT: armed bite in 262144 ticks (pre-shutdown)
  SWEET WDT: armed bite in 262144 ticks
  SWEET WDT: bite (STS=0x...)
  (if the clean path reaches the platform hook instead:)
  SWEET HALT: type=2 -> WDT reset
  SWEET RESET: PSCI SYSTEM_RESET
  SWEET RESET: PSCI returned 0xffffffffffffffff, falling back to watchdog
  SWEET WDT: armed bite in 8192 ticks
  SWEET WDT: bite (STS=0x...)

